<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>{{title}}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>{{title}}</h1>
    <p>{{who}}</p>

    <aside class="note" data-scaffold id="formulas">
      <h2>One block, six ways</h2>
      <p>The main offer: <strong id="focus">{{items.0.title}}</strong></p>
      <article class="variant" id="v-aida">
        <h3>AIDA</h3>
        <p class="block" data-part="attention"><span class="tag">Attention:</span> A familiar situation: the decision keeps getting put off, and time goes by.</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="interest"><span class="tag">Interest:</span> There is a simple way to sort it out, and it takes less time than it seems.</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="desire"><span class="tag">Desire:</span> Picture the question closed and you free to get on with other things.</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="action"><span class="tag">Action:</span> {{mainAction.label}}</p>
      </article>
      <article class="variant" id="v-aidca">
        <h3>AIDCA</h3>
        <p class="block" data-part="attention"><span class="tag">Attention:</span> A familiar situation: the decision keeps getting put off, and time goes by.</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="interest"><span class="tag">Interest:</span> There is a simple way to sort it out, and it takes less time than it seems.</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="desire"><span class="tag">Desire:</span> Picture the question closed and you free to get on with other things.</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="conviction"><span class="tag">Conviction:</span> {{#each proofs}}{{title}}. {{/each}}All of it can be checked against the documents.</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="action"><span class="tag">Action:</span> {{mainAction.label}}</p>
      </article>
      <article class="variant" id="v-acca">
        <h3>ACCA</h3>
        <p class="block" data-part="awareness"><span class="tag">Awareness:</span> A job like this can be done, and it has a clear name.</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="comprehension"><span class="tag">Comprehension:</span> First we go through your situation, then we name the time and the price, then we do the work.</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="conviction"><span class="tag">Conviction:</span> {{#each proofs}}{{title}}. {{/each}}All of it can be checked against the documents.</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="action"><span class="tag">Action:</span> {{mainAction.label}}</p>
      </article>
      <article class="variant" id="v-pas">
        <h3>PAS</h3>
        <p class="block" data-part="problem"><span class="tag">Problem:</span> The job has hung around for ages, and you don’t know where to start.</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="agitate"><span class="tag">Agitate:</span> The longer it waits, the more time and money it takes to put right.</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="solve"><span class="tag">Solve:</span> We go through your situation and give you a clear order of action.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="variant" id="v-paso">
        <h3>PASO</h3>
        <p class="block" data-part="problem"><span class="tag">Problem:</span> The job has hung around for ages, and you don’t know where to start.</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="agitate"><span class="tag">Agitate:</span> The longer it waits, the more time and money it takes to put right.</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="solution"><span class="tag">Solution:</span> We go through your situation and give you a clear order of action.</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="offer"><span class="tag">Offer:</span> A first conversation: the price is on the page, and we book you in within 3 business days.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="variant" id="v-slap">
        <h3>SLAP</h3>
        <p class="block" data-part="stop"><span class="tag">Stop:</span> Putting it off? Stop for a minute.</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="look"><span class="tag">Look:</span> The order of work and the price are on the page.</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="act"><span class="tag">Act:</span> {{mainAction.label}}</p>
        <p class="block" data-part="purchase"><span class="tag">Terms:</span> Price and time named before we start, a reply within 1 business day.</p>
      </article>
      <h3>The two best blocks</h3>
      <ul id="best">
